        <h1>N-EIF — Hybrid Expert System for an Enhanced Index Fund via Genetic Algorithm, Volume-Price Index, and LSTM Dueling DQN</h1>
        <div class="sub">An enhanced index fund in two phases: a genetic algorithm builds the tracking basket, then a volume–price regime indicator and a recurrent dueling DQN must agree before a trade happens. The paper's real contribution is decomposing how much each of the three layers is worth.</div>
